  "content": "<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/thumbnails/225/589/310/172/2015-09-12_22.png\" alt=\"頂部圖片\" width=\"306\" height=\"172\"></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>・新增真實比例的火車、鐵軌、車輛、標誌牌等</p><p>・可自訂模型並新增至遊戲中</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"color:#000\">※模組檔案<span style=\"color:#f00\">請勿解壓縮</span>直接放入mods資料夾。本模組<span style=\"color:#f00\">需搭配NGTLib前置模組</span>，請一併放入mods資料夾。<br>　將模組檔案直接放入mods資料夾，無需解壓縮。此模組<span style=\"color:#f00\">需要NGTLib</span>，請同時放入mods資料夾。<br><br>※請同時閱讀NGTLib的說明頁面</span></p><p><span style=\"color:#000\">　請閱讀NGTLib的說明頁面。</span></p><p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/ngtlib\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline;color:#00f\">https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/ngtlib</span></a></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"color:#000\">&lt;RTM模型包製作工具包 (RTM ModelPack Creation Kit)&gt;</span></p><p><del><span style=\"color:#000\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.dropbox.com%252fsh%252f2xmmxa66ptuyowx%252fAADneIlrlrNyJPSTRQsXh0ija%253fdl%253d0\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.dropbox.com/sh/2xmmxa66ptuyowx/AADneIlrlrNyJPSTRQsXh0ija?dl=0</a></span></del></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"color:#000\">&lt;更新日誌&gt;</span></p><p><span style=\"color:#000\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252f1drv.ms%252ft%252fs!AvWxR826KIn1jXdlIYDFvJfRbdEh%253fe%253dTdBebV\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://1drv.ms/t/s!AvWxR826KIn1jXdlIYDFvJfRbdEh?e=TdBebV</a></span></p>",
